{"4049810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lancer Tactics", "steam_appid": 4049810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lancer Tactics brings the world of the Lancer TTRPG to your screen. Create unique pilots and control incredible mechs as you battle for the future of Verdevilla, a new planet in the Lancer universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/d8c08078feab504ee8c5c058ea73da0c.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully customizable sandbox designed for player freedom. Lancer Tactics offers multiple ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your character through campaigns built by the devs and community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop right into combat with Instant Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own branching scenarios with a fully-developed Module Editor </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/81cc51db9f2c5a0f20e4443027a5f096.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge variety of pilot abilities and Lancer weaponry mean countless ways to design your builds and take on the fight. Create a stealthy assassin that teleports to their enemy for the finishing blow, a towering behemoth loaded with artillery, or thousands of other possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/d89c8287a58aaccb98ce97cfab561e5b.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lancer Tactics is designed for compatibility with the Lancer TTRPG, making it a great way to learn for new players while intuitive and powerful for veterans. Recreate your favorite builds from the tabletop game and explore new stories, or test out a build in Lancer Tactics and bring it to your next campaign with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re first discovering the Dawnline Shore or bringing your tried-and-true pilot to their next mission, Lancer Tactics awaits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink deep and descend, Lancer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lancer Tactics brings the world of the Lancer TTRPG to your screen. Create unique pilots and control incredible mechs as you battle for the future of Verdevilla, a new planet in the Lancer universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/d8c08078feab504ee8c5c058ea73da0c.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/304fadfacec45bec122255683e087013.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully customizable sandbox designed for player freedom. Lancer Tactics offers multiple ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your character through campaigns built by the devs and community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop right into combat with Instant Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own branching scenarios with a fully-developed Module Editor </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/81cc51db9f2c5a0f20e4443027a5f096.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/16418837d983975cbbfdb8e558911be3.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge variety of pilot abilities and Lancer weaponry mean countless ways to design your builds and take on the fight. Create a stealthy assassin that teleports to their enemy for the finishing blow, a towering behemoth loaded with artillery, or thousands of other possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/d89c8287a58aaccb98ce97cfab561e5b.webp?t=1782773870\" width=680 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.poster.avif?t=1782773870\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.webm?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/extras/6a9231c13b60b4be6c722cd77f598f00.mp4?t=1782773870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lancer Tactics is designed for compatibility with the Lancer TTRPG, making it a great way to learn for new players while intuitive and powerful for veterans. Recreate your favorite builds from the tabletop game and explore new stories, or test out a build in Lancer Tactics and bring it to your next campaign with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re first discovering the Dawnline Shore or bringing your tried-and-true pilot to their next mission, Lancer Tactics awaits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink deep and descend, Lancer.</p>", "short_description": "The iconic Lancer TTRPG, adapted to digital. Craft your Lancer from over 500 unique abilities and make your mark on the fight for Union's utopia. Play story-driven narrative campaigns, get right to battle in Instant Action, or build your own combats and campaigns with built-in sandbox editor tools.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/d8ea6426aacb0eae6493e92ce0a1a7cb1e664e24/header.jpg?t=1782773870", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/418ff9fc99f43b9e77df0eeac198684a6e2e052e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782773870", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/418ff9fc99f43b9e77df0eeac198684a6e2e052e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782773870", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850 / Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or macOS 11.0 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2017 or newer) OR Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics / AMD Radeon Pro 555X OR Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game must be run in compatibility mode on Intel chips.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 / AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ Cores, 2+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  2 GB VRAM, OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires OpenGL 3.3 compatible drivers.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB VRAM, NVIDIA GTX 970 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires Vulkan 1.2 or higher capable graphics drivers (Mesa 22.0+ or NVIDIA Proprietary Driver 510+).</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Lancer Tactics is not an official Lancer product; it is a third party work, and is not affiliated with Massif Press. Lancer Tactics is published via the Lancer Third Party License.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLancer is copyright Massif Press. ", "developers": ["Wickworks"], "publishers": ["Wickworks"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 17, "description": "Includes level editor"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/2ed19d4284781076976b4746c28f5b5f6bb4b69e/ss_2ed19d4284781076976b4746c28f5b5f6bb4b69e.600x338.jpg?t=1782773870", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/2ed19d4284781076976b4746c28f5b5f6bb4b69e/ss_2ed19d4284781076976b4746c28f5b5f6bb4b69e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782773870"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049810/fb38334f9f73a99a08a192bad224281ac439b21d/ss_fb38334f9f73a99a08a192bad22